<title>SINGAPORE: World rice prices - January 23.</title>
<headline>World rice prices - January 23.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rice prices quoted by trading and official sources in the key producing nations of Thailand, Vietnam, India and the United States in U.S. dollars a tonne:</p>
<p>							     Jan 23    Jan 16</p>
<p>Thailand-100 pct white B benchmark FOB Bangkok 380-400   380-400</p>
<p>Thailand-100 pct fragrant rice FOB Bangkok     620-640   620-640</p>
<p>India-25 pct broken(non-Basmati long grain)FOB 230	  230</p>
<p>India-15-10 pct broken FOB (west coast port)  245-280    245-280</p>
<p>Vietnam-5.0 percent broken FOB Saigon port    265-270    268-270</p>
<p>Vietnam-10 percent broken FOB Saigon port	258	  258</p>
<p>U.S.-California medium grain ($ per cwt) 19.00-20.50 21.00-22.00  </p>
<p>U.S.-Long grain Arkansas ($ per cwt)     20.00-21.00 21.00-22.00</p>
